  "description": "Wild Wadi Waterpark™ is Dubai’s original Family-friendly waterpark located near Dubai's iconic landmark, Burj Al Arab Jumeirah. With 30 Slides, Rides and Attraction, start with the Middle East’s largest wave pool, Breaker's Bay, and challenge yourself to pulse-racing rides like Jumeirah Sceirah or Master Blasters. If you’re joined by your little ones, Juha’s Dhow and Lagoon has over 100 enticing water-based activities. The real highlight of the water park is its fascinating theme inspired by Arabian folklore, the Legend of Juha. Wild Wadi is a 20-minute drive from downtown Dubai. Accessible to public bus, Taxi to get here. – Tripadvisor",
